# None of these are imported by CrocoDash/environment.yml's editable installs
# (rm6, mom6_forge, visualCaseGen, ipyfilechooser, CrocoDash itself all live
# under CrocoDash/CrocoDash/) -- excluding them shrinks the build context and
# the copied /workspace/CrocoDash tree without affecting anything at runtime.
CrocoDash/demos
CrocoDash/docs
CrocoDash/tests
CrocoDash/.github
CrocoDash/.git
